Converted    through      first full   calendar     credited 11th credited 16th
into P.T.O.  December     calendar     year through calendar year calendar year
Hours        31st of year year through 10th         through 15th  and
             of hire      5th calendar calendar     calendar year thereafter
                          year         year
Total P.T.O. 21 hours per 252 per      297 per      347 per year* 396 per year*
